Package: p4ui
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: p4-cli | helix-cli
Description: keyboard-driven terminal interface for Perforce
 Browse workspace changes, diffs, changelists, shelves, history and streams
 from a gitui-inspired terminal interface. Supports submitting, reconciling,
 syncing and resolving files through the Perforce command-line client.
 .
 The separately distributed Perforce p4 client must be available on PATH.
